# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# n8n NeuralGrid 프로덕션 환경변수
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ============================================================
# 🌐 Application Settings
# ============================================================
NODE_ENV=production
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://n8n.neuralgrid.kr
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://n8n.neuralgrid.kr/api

# ============================================================
# 🗄️ Database (PostgreSQL)
# ============================================================
# Docker Compose 내부 연결
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neuralgrid:CHANGE_THIS_PASSWORD@postgres:5432/neuralgrid

# Docker 환경변수
POSTGRES_USER=neuralgrid
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_THIS_PASSWORD
POSTGRES_DB=neuralgrid

# ============================================================
# 📮 Redis Cache
# ============================================================
REDIS_URL=redis://:CHANGE_THIS_PASSWORD@redis:6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=CHANGE_THIS_PASSWORD

# ============================================================
# ⚙️ n8n Configuration
# ============================================================
N8N_HOST=n8n.neuralgrid.kr
N8N_PROTOCOL=https
N8N_PORT=443
N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=GENERATE_WITH_openssl_rand_hex_32

# n8n 기본 인증 (관리자 접속)
N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER=admin
N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD=CHANGE_THIS_PASSWORD

# Webhook URL
WEBHOOK_URL=https://n8n.neuralgrid.kr/

# ============================================================
# 🔐 NextAuth.js (Authentication)
# ============================================================
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://n8n.neuralgrid.kr
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=GENERATE_WITH_openssl_rand_base64_32

# ============================================================
# 🌍 OAuth Providers
# ============================================================

# Google OAuth
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-your-google-secret

# Kakao OAuth
# https://developers.kakao.com/
KAKAO_CLIENT_ID=your-kakao-rest-api-key
KAKAO_CLIENT_SECRET=your-kakao-client-secret

# Naver OAuth
# https://developers.naver.com/
NAVER_CLIENT_ID=your-naver-client-id
NAVER_CLIENT_SECRET=your-naver-client-secret

# ============================================================
# 🤖 AI APIs
# ============================================================

# OpenAI (GPT-4, GPT-3.5)
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-your-openai-api-key

# Anthropic (Claude)
# https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-anthropic-api-key

# Google AI (Gemini)
# https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=AIzaSyYour-google-ai-api-key

# ============================================================
# 💳 Payment Gateway
# ============================================================

# TossPayments
# https://developers.tosspayments.com/
NEXT_PUBLIC_TOSS_CLIENT_KEY=live_ck_your_toss_client_key
TOSS_SECRET_KEY=live_sk_your_toss_secret_key

# Custom Payment API (선택사항)
CUSTOM_PAYMENT_API_URL=https://your-payment-api.com
CUSTOM_PAYMENT_API_KEY=your-custom-payment-api-key

# ============================================================
# 📧 Email Service (선택사항)
# ============================================================

# SendGrid
EMAIL_FROM=no-reply@neuralgrid.kr
SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.your-sendgrid-api-key

# ============================================================
# 📊 Monitoring & Analytics (선택사항)
# ============================================================

# Sentry (에러 트래킹)
SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id

# Google Analytics
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-YOUR_GA_ID

# ============================================================
# 🔔 Notifications (선택사항)
# ============================================================

# Slack Webhook
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/WEBHOOK/URL

# Discord Webhook
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/YOUR_WEBHOOK

# ============================================================
# 🛡️ Security
# ============================================================

# CORS 허용 도메인 (쉼표로 구분)
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://n8n.neuralgrid.kr,https://www.neuralgrid.kr

# API Rate Limiting
RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000

# ============================================================
# 💡 Tips
# ============================================================
#
# 1. 비밀번호/키 생성:
#    openssl rand -hex 32           # N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY
#    openssl rand -base64 32        # NEXTAUTH_SECRET
#    openssl rand -hex 16           # Database password
#
# 2. OAuth 설정:
#    - Redirect URI: https://n8n.neuralgrid.kr/api/auth/callback/{provider}
#    - 각 플랫폼의 개발자 콘솔에서 앱 등록 필요
#
# 3. TossPayments:
#    - 테스트: test_ck_*, test_sk_*
#    - 프로덕션: live_ck_*, live_sk_*
#
# 4. 보안:
#    - 모든 SECRET/PASSWORD는 반드시 변경
#    - .env 파일은 절대 Git에 커밋하지 말 것
#    - 정기적으로 키 로테이션 권장
#
# ============================================================
